{"sequence":2,"at":"2026-09-26T19:43:39.692Z","kind":"response","attemptId":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"response","startedAt":"2026-09-26T19:42:50.554Z","request":{"messageCount":1,"messageCharacters":8712,"toolNames":["submit_authorization_result"],"toolChoice":{"name":"submit_authorization_result"},"maxTokens":6000,"temperature":0,"executableTools":false,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"obligationId":{"type":"string"},"conclusion":{"type":"string","enum":["source_supported_failure","source_refuted","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["entry","binding","control","effect","condition"]},"statement":{"type":"string"},"citations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"sourceId":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"number"},"endLine":{"type":"number"}},"required":["sourceId","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["id","kind","statement","citations"],"additionalProperties":false}},"decisiveMissingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"suggestedObservations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["obligationId","conclusion","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":2409,"output":981,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_C6Aa5beY4MoyhMIltuEGRZM3","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Anon-admin-without-kb-write-grant::entry%3Apost-process-text","conclusion":"source_refuted","explanation":"The fixed source supports enforcement of the declared policy for this path. The POST /process/text handler obtains its caller through get_verified_user, takes the supplied collection_name, and invokes _validate_collection_access with access_type='write' before constructing the document or calling save_docs_to_vector_db. That validator delegates to filter_accessible_collections. For a non-admin and an existing knowledge-base name, the shared policy adds the name only when Knowledges.check_access_by_user_id(..., permission='write') succeeds; if the check fails and the knowledge base exists, the legacy/ephemeral fallback does not apply. The validator then raises HTTP 403 for the denied name, so the attacker-selected text does not reach the vector-database write sink under the stated condition.","facts":[{"id":"entry-post-process-text","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared entry is the POST /process/text handler, which receives a verified user and processes the submitted text.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":7,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"principal-verified-user","kind":"binding","statement":"The request principal is bound through the get_verified_user dependency.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":8,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"operation-and-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The operation uses the supplied form_data.collection_name as the target collection when it is present.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"write-policy-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler invokes collection-access validation with access_type='write', and the validator delegates to the shared accessible-collection policy.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":16,"endLine":18},{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":31,"endLine":39}]},{"id":"non-admin-existing-kb-control","kind":"control","statement":"For non-admin users, an ordinary collection name is admitted only when the knowledge-base access check succeeds for the requested access type; if no knowledge base exists, only then is it treated as a legacy or ephemeral collection and allowed.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":10,"endLine":20},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"protected-vector-write-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After validation, the submitted text is placed in a document and passed with the selected collection name to save_docs_to_vector_db.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":19,"endLine":28}]},{"id":"denial-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"A denied requested collection causes the validator to raise HTTP 403 before the vector-database write call.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":37,"endLine":44}]},{"id":"stated-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The relevant stated condition is a non-admin principal targeting an existing knowledge base without an explicit write grant, so the write permission check does not succeed and the existing-KB fallback is unavailable.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":21,"endLine":23},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2409,"output":981,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":49136.39739999996,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-26T19:43:39.692Z"}}
